  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647552352.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;visibility:visible;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647552352.png\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;visibility:visible;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647556582.jpg\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">改革开放以来，经过几十年的发展努力，农产品批发市场已成为联结亿万农民与消费者的重要纽带，是商流、物流、信息流、资金流的重要集散中心，也是农产品集中、分散和价格形成的重要环节。据统计，全国有农批市场近5000家，几乎覆盖了所有的大中小城市和农产品集中产区，大中城市消费鲜活农产品70%以上是通过农批市场提供并进入百姓的菜篮子。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">要想真正管好百姓的菜篮子，农批市场要走的路还很远。市场内部长期存在着进场收费跑冒滴漏、市场监管困难、管理效率低、盈利模式单一等诸多问题。同时作为农产品供应链条中扮演着重要角色的批发市场也面临着外部压力，诸如农产品生产基地直接对接生鲜商超、线上生鲜商超平台的快速崛起，逐渐改变百姓传统的消费模式等压力，这些都削弱农批市场在农产品供应链中的话语权。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">转型升级是农产品批发市场内外部环境共同作用下的内生动力，围绕着农产品批发市场的一场数字化革命势在必行。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">古河云科技自研的“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以中台化思想、云架构理念为核心，依托物联网、数字孪生、云计算、AI等前沿科技技术，围绕集成接入、技术支撑、业务应用、产品矩阵、解决方案等五大维度进行产品技术整合，构建起一套能够融合各类三方软硬件系统并且适用于全业务应用场景的数字化底层支撑平台。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">古河云农批数字化综合业务管理平台基于“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以农产品信息、数据、物流、配送、仓储、冷链、质量安全溯源等为核心，从而构建起基于农产品进销存、供应链管理、电子支付、市场管理、物流配送与仓储服务等多维度的综合业务管理平台，其平台设计之初便是为了满足农批市场管理发展需要且可持续提升，实现更快速准确地掌握市场经营情况、提高管理效率，搭建起一套互联互通，数据共享的管理平台。<br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br/></p><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647569332.png\" alt=\"3\" title=\"3\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">农批数字化综合业务管理平台以一平台管理、一数据服务搭配上多终端运营，让管理随时随地轻松掌控。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">“一平台管理”是围绕着整个农批市场管理，从基础综合服务管理出发，聚焦进出场、肉类滑轨、溯源监管、园区管理等多个细分业务场景，打通各个业务管理之间的壁垒屏障，形成一个统一的管理平台，利用数字化技术，为员工能力赋能，提升工作效率。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647563005.jpg\" alt=\"4\" title=\"4\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">“一数据服务”是将各个业务管理系统数据汇总到管理平台中，通过数据中台对业务数据的沉淀管理，实现数据与业务之间，数据与系统之间，数据与外部之间的有效互通；并能通过可视化数据，呈现经营指标，风险指标，数据及时准确，支撑不同维度经营分析，让数据一目了然，实施监管，为管理提供先进的分析预测能力。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761647567784.png\" alt=\"5\" title=\"5\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">“多终端运营”是结合市场、商户、采购方各自的业务需求打造出专属电脑端与移动端软件，推动农批市场业务创新，科技赋能日常管理，让不同角色都能够随时随地处理业务。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">农批数字化综合业务管理平台所具备的业务信息化、设备智能化、数据可视化、三维立体化等诸多特点吸引了众多知名农产品批发市场的青睐，至今落地项目近150家，累计建设项目覆盖19省30市。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">未来古河云科技将持续发挥自身技术优势，关注并实践技术的创新与升级，为农产品批发市场数字化转型注入新的动能。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><p><br /></p>",
